      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "23",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mumwaka wamu chitanu nachiyedi Yehoyada hakudikolesha, hakutiyaŋana chitiyaŋenu nawawakulumpi amakulakaji, mwana kaYerohami Azariya, ni mwana kaYehohanani Ishimeli, ni mwana kaObedi Azariya, ni mwana kaAdaya Mayaseya, ni mwana kaZikiri Elishafwati. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hiyakuyanakukimbuka muYuda nakupompesha aLevi munyikala yawaYuda yejima, niakulumpi akumavumu awankakulula jawaIsarela, hiyakwinza nikuYerusalema.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chipompelu chejima hichikutiyapana chitiyaŋenu namwanta mwitala daNzambi. Yehoyada hakuyila nindi, Tiyenu, mwana kamwanta wakayulamwomwanahoshiyi Yehova mwanateniyi anyana kaDavidi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tiyenu chimwakela, chibalu chimu chachisatu cheŋilaŋa hefuku dasabata, enu atupristu nawaLevi, enu yenu mwakekala akwakuhemba kuyisu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "chibalu chikwawu chachisatu chakekali kwitala damwanta; chibalu chikwawu chachisatu chakekali kuchisu chakuchikuku; antu ejima akekali muyipaŋu yakwitala daYehova. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bayi hamwekana wukwijila mwitala daYehovaku, chiŋa atupristu nawaLevi akalakalaŋa hohu; diwu akwijila muloŋa ajila; hakwila antu ejima akahembaŋa wulama waYehova. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ALevi akamwimeni mwanta kwi-ndo, iku anakwati yitwa yawu kumakasawu wejima wawu; yowu wukwijila mwitala akamujaha; mwakayaŋa namwanta nihakenilayini hakedikayi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ALevi nawaYuda ejima elili mwayilejeli kapristu Yehoyada mwejima. Wejima wawu hiyakutambula antu awu, ninawa epilili hefuku dasabata, ninawa akombokeli hefuku dasabata; muloŋa kapristu Yehoyada hamwaŋili mazanvu awuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kapristu Yehoyada hakuyinka awakulumpi amakombakajini mayoŋa, ninkebu janyanya, ninkebu jamaneni, jadiŋi jamwanta Davidi, jadiŋi mwitala daNzambi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakuyimika antu ejima, wejima wawuanakwati yitwa yawu kumakasawu, kufumisha kumutamba wetala wachidiilukushika nikumutamba wetala wachimunswa, hiyakukulisha nikukameŋa, nikwitala, nikudi mwanta kwi-ndo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakumwidisha mwana kamwanta, hakumuvwika nichibaaba, hakumwinka niwunsahu, hakumudiisha wanta. Yehoyada nawanyanindi amayala hiyakumuwayisha manji, hiyakwila nawu, Kalombu mwanta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ataliya chatiyiliyi ipumba dawantu akuhitahita lufuchi nakuhameka mwanta, hakwinza kudi antu mwitala daYehova. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nindi atali, mwantaowu nemani kuchishimi chindi kuwiŋililu, niakulumpi anjita nimpùŋa jidikudi mwanta; antu ejima amwituŋa adi nakuzapalala, adi nakwimba mpupa; niakwakwimba tumina nawa adi nakwimba yisanji, adi nakwimbisha tuminatwakuhameka. Ataliya hakutabola mahinindi, nindi, Anankwatili makasu! Anankwatili makasu!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kapristu Yehoyada hakwidisha awakulumpi amakulakaji enkeiuwuwuawakulumpi wanjita, hakuyila nindi, Muhanwishenu munyisululu. Yowu wukumulonda mukumujaha nampoku yakabali. Muloŋa kapristu welilinindi, Bayi akamujahila mwitala daYehovaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hiyakumushila njila, hakuya njila yakuwiŋililu wakuchisu chawatuwalu chakuchipaŋu chakwitalada mwanta; hiya kumujahila kwenoku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehoyada hakwila chitiyaŋenu chakutiyapana niyena niantu ejimani mwanta, chakwila nawu, Tukwikala antu aYehova. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Antu ejimahiyakuya kwitala daBayali, hiyakudihumuna. Hiyakubalula nitumeŋatwindi niakishi indi kwapuchi-puchi, hiyakujaha nikapristu kaBayali Matani, kumesu atumepa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehoyada hakwinka atupristu nawaLevi nyidi muya kwitala daYehova, wowu apaŋililiyi Davidi mwitala daYehova kulonda amushitilaŋa Yehova nyilambu yakushita, mwasonekeluwu kunshimbi jaMosi, nakuzaŋalala nakwimba tumina mwaloŋesheliyi Davidi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuyi suya kwitala daYehova washiluku akwakuhemba, kulonda akweti majilu helaanka, hela anka, abuli kwijila mu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakutambula awakulumpi amakulakaji, niantu alema nianguvulu awantu niantu ejima amwituŋa, hakukunku mwishamwanta, hakumufumisha kwitala daYehova; hiyakuhitila muchisu chakwiwulu, hiyakushika kwitala damwanta, hiya kumu shakamisha mwanta hetandada wanta wetuŋa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Antu amwituŋa ejima hiyakuzapalala, mumukala mumwena nizo-o. Ataliya anamujahi dehi nampoku yakabali.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
